        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Mirevaine, we believe true luxury whispers. We eschew ephemeral trends in pursuit of timeless design, working exclusively with multi-generational family workshops across Northern Italy and Portugal.</p><p>Every seam, hand-burnished edge, and bespoke gold-vermeil clasp is calibrated for decades of effortless wear.</p>"
